<p>This doesn’t give us anything we couldn’t do before:<a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/03/image.png"><img style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; margin: 25px 0px 0px 5px; display: inline; border-top: 0px; border-right: 0px" title="image" border="0" alt="image" src="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/03/image_thumb.png" width="150" height="227" /></a>&#160; </p>
</p>
<p>So how do we represent this grouping?&#160; </p>
