<p>&#160;</p>
<p>We’ve told WPF, take all of the Groups out of the CollectionViewSource and put each into a Container (just like it would with individual items), that container being a GroupItem instead of a ListItem.&#160; Style the GroupItem such that its Template is a GroupBox with an ItemsPresenter inside to display each individual item.&#160; You can do a lot with this and it also works with the GridView form of a ListView.</p>
