<p>Notice we use the ScrollViewer’s ActualWidth as our “containerSize”.&#160; The ItemsControl itself has the “totalItems” count, and finally we are using a Slider with the name “scaleSize” to adjust the “visibleItems” count.</p>
<p>Code for the <a href="http://code.cromwellhaus.com/ShowingOnlyXVisibleItemsInItemsControl/ShowingOnlyXVisibleItemsInItemsControl.xbap" target="_blank">Xbap sample</a> at the top can be downloaded <a href="http://code.cromwellhaus.com/ShowingOnlyXVisibleItemsInItemsControl/ShowingOnlyXVisibleItemsInItemsControl.zip">here</a>.</p>
