</pre>
<pre style="background-color: #fbfbfb; margin: 0em; width: 100%; font-family: consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,courier,monospace; font-size: 12px">        <span style="color: #0000ff">&lt;</span><span style="color: #800000">ListView</span> <span style="color: #ff0000">ItemsSource</span>=<span style="color: #0000ff">&quot;{Binding Attacks}&quot;</span> <span style="color: #0000ff">/&gt;</span>
